# Editing

- Prefer editing existing files over creating new ones
- Preserve existing formatting and indentation
- Do not expand scope beyond the requested change
- If a linter or checker is configured, run it after changes and fix new issues
- Do not edit or invent React/TypeScript/Vite conventions from other projects; this repo is a WoW addon
